                text: [
                    "Joash was only 7 years old when he became king of Judah! Because he was so young, a wise priest named Jehoiada helped guide him in doing what was right.",
                    "Joash noticed that God's temple was damaged and needed repairs. He placed a special wooden chest at the temple gate so people could donate silver coins cheerfully.",
                    "Workers used the money to fix the stone walls, repair doors, and make golden vessels for worship. Joash honored God as long as he listened to Godly advice."
                ],
                quiz: {
                    question: "How old was Joash when he first became king?",
                    options: [
                        "7 years old",
                        "18 years old",
                        "25 years old"
                    ],
                    correctIndex: 0
                }
            },
            {
                id: "hezekiah",
                name: "Hezekiah",
                meaning: "The King Who Prayed and Was Healed",
                chronology: "13th King of Judah",
                scripture: "2 Kings 18-20 • 2 Chronicles 29-32",
                obeyedGod: true,
                emoji: "📜",
                soundAction: () => SoundFX.templeChime(),
                svgArt: `<svg class="w-36 h-36 floating" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" fill="#f0fdf4" />
                    <path d="M70 60 L130 60 L140 140 L60 140 Z" fill="#bbf7d0" />
                    <path d="M80 80 L120 80 M80 100 L120 100 M80 120 L110 120" stroke="#166534" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
                    <circle cx="140" cy="60" r="12" fill="#22c55e" />
                </svg>`,
                summary: [
                    "Trusted God more than almost any other king of Judah.",
                    "Prayed when a huge Assyrian army threatened Jerusalem.",
                    "God added 15 more years to his life after he prayed during sickness."
                ],
                text: [
                    "King Hezekiah trusted the Lord completely. He reopened God's temple, brought back the Passover celebration, and smashed idol monuments.",
                    "When the scary army of Assyria surrounded Jerusalem, their leader sent a letter mocking God. Hezekiah took the letter, laid it out in the temple, and prayed for God's help. God sent an angel to save Jerusalem!",
                    "Later, Hezekiah became very sick. He wept and prayed to God. God heard his prayer, healed him, and added 15 whole years to his life!"
                ],
                quiz: {
                    question: "What did Hezekiah do when he received a threatening letter from the enemy?",
                    options: [
                        "He surrendered immediately",
                        "He laid it out in God's temple and prayed",
                        "He burned the letter without reading it"
                    ],
                    correctIndex: 1
                }
            },
            {
                id: "manasseh",
                name: "Manasseh",
                meaning: "The King Who Repented in Trouble",
                chronology: "14th King of Judah",
                scripture: "2 Kings 21 • 2 Chronicles 33",
                obeyedGod: false,
                emoji: "⛓️",
                soundAction: () => SoundFX.battleSound(),
                svgArt: `<svg class="w-36 h-36 floating" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" fill="#faf5ff" />
                    <rect x="70" y="70" width="60" height="60" rx="8" fill="#6b21a8" />
                    <path d="M50 110 L150 110 M100 60 L100 160" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="6" />
                </svg>`,
                summary: [
                    "Ruled for 55 years (the longest reign of any Judahite king).",
                    "Was very disobedient for most of his life.",
                    "Humbled himself, prayed in prison, and God forgave him!"
                ],
                text: [
                    "Manasseh was Hezekiah's son, but at first, he was very disobedient. He built fake idol altars right inside God's holy temple and led the people into doing terrible things.",
                    "Because of his bad choices, the King of Assyria captured Manasseh, put hooks in him, and carried him away in chains to Babylon.",
                    "In deep trouble, Manasseh realized his sin. He humbled himself greatly and prayed to God for mercy. God forgave him and restored him back to his throne, where Manasseh spent his remaining days cleaning up his past mistakes!"
                ],
                quiz: {
                    question: "What lesson do we learn from Manasseh's life?",
                    options: [
                        "God never listens when someone makes mistakes",
                        "God is merciful when we truly humble ourselves and ask forgiveness",
                        "Being bad makes you a stronger ruler"
                    ],
                    correctIndex: 1
                }
            },
            {
                id: "josiah",
                name: "Josiah",
                meaning: "The King Who Found the Lost Law",
                chronology: "16th King of Judah",
                scripture: "2 Kings 22-23 • 2 Chronicles 34-35",
                obeyedGod: true,
                emoji: "📖",
                soundAction: () => SoundFX.templeChime(),
                svgArt: `<svg class="w-36 h-36 floating" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" fill="#fef3c7" />
                    <!-- Scroll -->
                    <path d="M50 70 C50 60 65 60 70 70 L70 130 C65 140 50 140 50 130 Z" fill="#d97706" />
                    <path d="M150 70 C150 60 135 60 130 70 L130 130 C135 140 150 140 150 130 Z" fill="#d97706" />
                    <rect x="65" y="65" width="70" height="70" fill="#fef08a" />
                    <path d="M75 80 L125 80 M75 95 L125 95 M75 110 L110 110" stroke="#b45309" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" />
                </svg>`,
                summary: [
                    "Became king at 8 years old and loved God with all his heart.",
                    "Found the lost Book of the Law inside the temple.",
                    "Read God's word aloud to all the people and made a covenant to follow it."
                ],
                text: [
                    "Josiah became king when he was 8 years old. Scripture says there was no king like him who turned to the Lord with all his heart, soul, and strength!",
                    "While workers were cleaning and repairing the temple, Hilkiah the priest found a forgotten scroll: God's Book of the Law! When Josiah heard God's words read to him, he tore his robes in sorrow because the people had forgotten God.",
                    "Josiah gathered all the citizens of Judah—from young to old—and read the entire Bible scroll to them. Together, they promised to obey God with all their hearts."
                ],
                quiz: {
                    question: "What important treasure was found in the temple during Josiah's reign?",
                    options: [
                        "A hidden chest of ancient gold coins",
                        "The forgotten Book of God's Law (Scripture)",
                        "An ancient king's lost sword"
                    ],
                    correctIndex: 1
                }
            }
        ];

        const app = {
            activeFilter: 'all',
            currentKingId: null,
            score: parseInt(localStorage.getItem('judah_score') || '0'),
            unlockedCrowns: JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('judah_crowns') || '[]'),
            isSpeaking: false,

            init() {
                this.updateScoreboard();
                this.renderKingsGrid();
                this.renderBadgeGrid();
            },

            updateScoreboard() {
                document.getElementById('stars-display').innerText = this.score;
                document.getElementById('crown-display').innerText = `${this.unlockedCrowns.length} Crowns`;
                document.getElementById('gallery-count').innerText = `${this.unlockedCrowns.length} / ${kingsData.length} Kings Mastered`;
                
                localStorage.setItem('judah_score', this.score);
                localStorage.setItem('judah_crowns', JSON.stringify(this.unlockedCrowns));
            },

            addStars(amt) {
                this.score += amt;
                this.updateScoreboard();
            },

            unlockCrown(kingId) {
                if (!this.unlockedCrowns.includes(kingId)) {
                    this.unlockedCrowns.push(kingId);
                    this.updateScoreboard();
                    this.renderKingsGrid();
                    this.renderBadgeGrid();
                }
            },

            setFilter(filterType) {
                SoundFX.click();
                this.activeFilter = filterType;

                const btnAll = document.getElementById('filter-all');
                const btnGood = document.getElementById('filter-good');
                const btnBad = document.getElementById('filter-bad');

                // Reset styles
                [btnAll, btnGood, btnBad].forEach(btn => {
                    btn.className = "flex-1 sm:flex-none px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-kids text-sm transition-all border-2 bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100";
                });

                if (filterType === 'all') {
                    btnAll.className = "flex-1 sm:flex-none px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-kids text-sm transition-all border-2 bg-amber-500 text-white border-amber-600 shadow";
                } else if (filterType === 'good') {
                    btnGood.className = "flex-1 sm:flex-none px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-kids text-sm transition-all border-2 bg-emerald-500 text-white border-emerald-600 shadow";
                } else if (filterType === 'bad') {
                    btnBad.className = "flex-1 sm:flex-none px-4 py-2 rounded-xl font-kids text-sm transition-all border-2 bg-rose-500 text-white border-rose-600 shadow";
                }

                this.renderKingsGrid();
            },

            scrollToTimeline() {
                SoundFX.click();
                document.getElementById('timeline-anchor').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' });
            },

            showHome() {
                SoundFX.click();
                this.stopSpeech();
                document.getElementById('view-story').classList.add('hidden');
                document.getElementById('view-home').classList.remove('hidden');
                window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
            },

            openRandomKing() {
                SoundFX.click();
                const randomIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * kingsData.length);
                this.openKing(kingsData[randomIndex].id);
            },

            openKing(kingId) {
                SoundFX.click();
                this.stopSpeech();
                this.currentKingId = kingId;
                const king = kingsData.find(k => k.id === kingId);
                if (!king) return;

                document.getElementById('king-title').innerText = king.name;
                document.getElementById('king-meaning').innerText = `"${king.meaning}"`;
                document.getElementById('king-chronology').innerText = king.chronology;
                document.getElementById('king-scripture').innerText = king.scripture;
                document.getElementById('king-illustration').innerHTML = king.svgArt;

                // Obedience Tag
                const tagEl = document.getElementById('king-obedience-tag');
                if (king.obeyedGod) {
                    tagEl.className = "flex items-center gap-2 font-kids text-sm px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border shadow-sm bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900 border-emerald-300";
                    tagEl.innerHTML = `<span>😇</span> <span>Obeyed God's Commandments</span>`;
                } else {
                    tagEl.className = "flex items-center gap-2 font-kids text-sm px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border shadow-sm bg-rose-100 text-rose-900 border-rose-300";
                    tagEl.innerHTML = `<span>😠</span> <span>Disobeyed God's Laws</span>`;
                }

                // Quick Summary Bullet points
                const summaryList = document.getElementById('king-summary-list');
                summaryList.innerHTML = king.summary.map(s => `<li>${s}</li>`).join('');

                // Story Body Paragraphs
                const bodyContainer = document.getElementById('king-body');
                bodyContainer.innerHTML = king.text.map(p => `<p>${p}</p>`).join('');

                // Quiz setup
                this.renderQuiz(king.quiz);

                // Switch views
                document.getElementById('view-home').classList.add('hidden');
                document.getElementById('view-story').classList.remove('hidden');
                window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
            },

            playKingSound() {
                const king = kingsData.find(k => k.id === this.currentKingId);
                if (king && king.soundAction) {
                    king.soundAction();
                }
            },

            renderQuiz(quiz) {
                const qEl = document.getElementById('quiz-question');
                const optsEl = document.getElementById('quiz-options');
                const feedbackEl = document.getElementById('quiz-feedback');

                qEl.innerText = quiz.question;
                feedbackEl.classList.add('hidden');
                feedbackEl.className = "mt-6 hidden p-4 rounded-2xl text-center font-kids text-lg border-2";

                optsEl.innerHTML = '';
                quiz.options.forEach((optText, idx) => {
                    const btn = document.createElement('button');
                    btn.className = "w-full text-left bg-slate-800 hover:bg-indigo-950 border-2 border-indigo-700 text-white font-semibold p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all text-base sm:text-lg flex items-center justify-between group cursor-pointer";
                    btn.innerHTML = `<span>${optText}</span> <span class="bg-indigo-800 text-amber-300 w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-kids group-hover:bg-amber-400 group-hover:text-amber-950 transition-colors">${String.fromCharCode(65 + idx)}</span>`;
                    btn.onclick = () => this.handleQuizAnswer(idx, quiz.correctIndex, btn);
                    optsEl.appendChild(btn);
                });
            },

            handleQuizAnswer(selectedIdx, correctIdx, btnEl) {
                const feedbackEl = document.getElementById('quiz-feedback');
                const allOpts = document.querySelectorAll('#quiz-options button');
                
                allOpts.forEach(b => b.disabled = true);

                if (selectedIdx === correctIdx) {
                    SoundFX.correct();
                    btnEl.classList.remove('bg-slate-800', 'border-indigo-700');
                    btnEl.classList.add('bg-emerald-600', 'text-white', 'border-emerald-400');
                    
                    feedbackEl.innerText = "🎉 Excellent! You got it right! You earned +10 Stars and unlocked a Golden Crown!";
                    feedbackEl.classList.remove('hidden');
                    feedbackEl.classList.add('bg-emerald-950', 'text-emerald-200', 'border-emerald-500', 'animate-bounce');

                    this.addStars(10);
                    this.unlockCrown(this.currentKingId);
                } else {
                    SoundFX.wrong();
                    btnEl.classList.remove('bg-slate-800', 'border-indigo-700');
                    btnEl.classList.add('bg-rose-600', 'text-white', 'border-rose-400');
                    
                    allOpts[correctIdx].classList.remove('bg-slate-800', 'border-indigo-700');
                    allOpts[correctIdx].classList.add('bg-emerald-600', 'text-white', 'border-emerald-400');

                    feedbackEl.innerText = "❌ Not quite! Read the king's story again above to discover the right answer!";
                    feedbackEl.classList.remove('hidden');
                    feedbackEl.classList.add('bg-rose-950', 'text-rose-200', 'border-rose-500');
                }
            },

            renderKingsGrid() {
                const grid = document.getElementById('kings-grid');
                let filtered = kingsData;

                if (this.activeFilter === 'good') {
                    filtered = kingsData.filter(k => k.obeyedGod);
                } else if (this.activeFilter === 'bad') {
                    filtered = kingsData.filter(k => !k.obeyedGod);
                }

                grid.innerHTML = filtered.map(king => {
                    const isMastered = this.unlockedCrowns.includes(king.id);
                    return `
                        <div onclick="app.openKing('${king.id}')" class="king-card bg-white rounded-3xl p-5 shadow-md border-4 ${king.obeyedGod ? 'border-emerald-200 hover:border-emerald-400' : 'border-rose-200 hover:border-rose-400'} cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden">
                            <div>
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
                                    <span class="text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full ${king.obeyedGod ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800' : 'bg-rose-100 text-rose-800'}">
                                        ${king.obeyedGod ? '😇 Obeyed God' : '😠 Disobeyed God'}
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="text-3xl">${king.emoji}</span>
                                </div>
                                <h4 class="font-kids text-2xl text-amber-950 mb-1">${king.name}</h4>
                                <p class="text-xs text-amber-700 font-bold mb-3">${king.chronology}</p>
                                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm line-clamp-2 font-medium">${king.summary[0]}</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600">
                                <span>Read Story ➔</span>
                                ${isMastered ? '<span class="text-amber-500 text-lg" title="Crown Earned!">👑</span>' : '<span class="text-slate-300">🔒</span>'}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    `;
                }).join('');
            },

            renderBadgeGrid() {
                const badgeGrid = document.getElementById('badge-grid');
                badgeGrid.innerHTML = kingsData.map(king => {
                    const isUnlocked = this.unlockedCrowns.includes(king.id);
                    return `
                        <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-2 border-2 ${isUnlocked ? 'bg-amber-100 border-amber-400 shadow-sm' : 'bg-slate-100 border-dashed border-slate-300 opacity-60'}">
                            <span class="text-3xl mb-1">${isUnlocked ? '👑' : '🔒'}</span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-kids text-center ${isUnlocked ? 'text-amber-950' : 'text-slate-400'} line-clamp-1">${king.name}</span>
                        </div>
                    `;
                }).join('');
            },

            toggleSpeech() {
                if ('speechSynthesis' in window) {
                    if (this.isSpeaking) {
                        this.stopSpeech();
                    } else {
                        const king = kingsData.find(k => k.id === this.currentKingId);
                        if (!king) return;
                        
                        window.speechSynthesis.cancel();
                        const fullText = `${king.name}. ${king.meaning}. Key summary: ${king.summary.join(". ")}. Story: ${king.text.join(" ")}`;
                        const utterance = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(fullText);
                        utterance.rate = 0.92; // Slightly slower for clarity
                        utterance.pitch = 1.05;

                        utterance.onstart = () => {
                            this.isSpeaking = true;
                            document.getElementById('tts-label').innerText = "Stop Speech";
                            document.getElementById('tts-btn').classList.replace('bg-indigo-600', 'bg-rose-600');
                            document.getElementById('tts-btn').classList.replace('border-indigo-800', 'border-rose-800');
                        };

                        utterance.onend = () => {
                            this.stopSpeech();
                        };

                        utterance.onerror = () => {
                            this.stopSpeech();
                        };

                        window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);
                    }
                } else {
                    console.warn("Text-to-speech is not supported in this browser environment.");
                }
            },

            stopSpeech() {
                if ('speechSynthesis' in window) {
                    window.speechSynthesis.cancel();
                }
                this.isSpeaking = false;
                const label = document.getElementById('tts-label');
                const btn = document.getElementById('tts-btn');
                if (label && btn) {
                    label.innerText = "Read Story Aloud";
                    btn.classList.replace('bg-rose-600', 'bg-indigo-600');
                    btn.classList.replace('border-rose-800', 'border-indigo-800');
                }
            }
        };

        window.onload = () => {
            app.init();
        };

        document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {
            if (document.hidden) {
                app.stopSpeech();
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
